  "2026-10-29T12:20:32.182Z",codex-agent,"Final packed acceptance passed on both 2026.10.24 and 2026.10.28 hosts in project-local, npm-global, Bun-global, npx and bunx layouts: 10/10 combinations, 310 feature checks, 60 ordinary CLI writer interleavings and 50 retained/retried identities, including completed-item edits and fresh multi-item retries through both importer aliases. The exact artifact is SHA-256 5bde2fb7ab6b043d29ffaf18020a1740552546f8966152dd67817493a949243f; all 9 current shipped files match. The read-only public-copy measurement remains 112 items, 232 files, 1644154 bytes, 2 inspections, 275-byte JSON and unchanged SHA-256; it contains zero unit contracts, so synthetic SDK trackers supply conversion evidence. Static/type/docstring (108 declarations), focused SDK and all current behavioral reverts passed. Full 500-sequence model and npm/Bun release-gate evidence will be taken from the pushed head CI and recorded on PR 189; no earlier head is claimed as final-head verification."
